SRE Rollback Checklist
 Previous EndpointConfig captured
 Validation failure detected
 Automatic rollback executed
 Endpoint returned to InService
 Previous version restored
 Rollback event logged
 Alert generated
 Deployment marked failed


Production Promotion Policy
Validation Pass
    → Promote

Validation Fail
    → Automatic Rollback

Rollback Fail
    → Open Critical Incident


